= Building a People's Party

We can build a broader social democratic coalition among workers, small farmers, shopkeepers and public employees. The programme will require compromise within our party.

- @support: Adopt the broader programme.
- @root: Keep our current programme.
- @easy_discard

@support
on-arrival: peoples_party = 1; month_actions += 1; rural_chp += 5*(1-dissent); petty_bourgeoisie_chp += 4*(1-dissent); state_employees_chp += 4*(1-dissent); kemalist_marxists_dissent += 5
achievement: peoples_party

We adopt a programme that connects social democratic reform with the needs of people across the country.

- @peoples_party_campaigning: Publicize our programme.
- @root: Return to party affairs.
